#
# Test-harness-local Emits SigOp `emit : Eff Int Unit` (Plan 0.36).
# Runtime = NOP: the observable is the SigOp trace (asserted at the Agda
# `obs` level), not stdout. Takes its Int argument in %rdi (Once SysV
# convention), returns Unit; touches no callee-saved register.

.text
.align 16
.global emit
.type emit, @function
emit:
    ret
.size emit, .-emit
